{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "layer": "L8",
  "title": "PigeonBox core 安全测试层矩阵（L8）",
  "owner": "pigeonbox/core",
  "updated": "2026-11-18",
  "description": "L8 = 安全层。六个威胁类为矩阵主键；本清单是机器可读的覆盖真相源，由 scripts/check-l8-security-matrix.sh 与 pkg/l8/matrix_guard_test.go 双向对账（清单里每条必须有仓内真实测试；仓内每个安全测试文件/函数必须登记进清单）。",
  "classes": [
    {
      "id": "auth_bypass",
      "title": "认证旁路",
      "min_cases": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "authz",
      "title": "越权（横向/纵向）",
      "min_cases": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "ssrf",
      "title": "SSRF",
      "min_cases": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "pickup_enum",
      "title": "取件码枚举",
      "min_cases": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "path_escape",
      "title": "路径逃逸",
      "min_cases": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "resource_exhaustion",
      "title": "资源耗尽",
      "min_cases": 6
    }
  ],
  "discovery": {
    "description": "「什么算 L8 安全测试文件」的识别规则（路径 glob，模块根相对）。命中任一 glob 且未登记进 cases 的文件 ⇒ 门禁判红（新安全测试必须登记进矩阵）。**/l8_*_test.go 覆盖全仓新增的 L8 用例文件。",
    "globs": [
      "**/l8_*_test.go",
      "pkg/auth/*_test.go",
      "pkg/authz/*_test.go",
      "pkg/security/*_test.go",
      "pkg/outbound/outbound_test.go",
      "pkg/outbound/ssrf*_test.go",
      "pkg/gate/*_test.go",
      "pkg/totp/*_test.go",
      "pkg/middleware/auth*_test.go",
      "pkg/middleware/apikey*_test.go",
      "pkg/middleware/lockout*_test.go",
      "pkg/middleware/ratelimit*_test.go",
      "pkg/middleware/security_test.go",
      "transport/http/middleware/*_test.go",
      "app/federation/*ssrf*_test.go",
      "app/preview/enum_lockout_test.go",
      "app/admin/auth_totp_test.go",
      "app/admin/webauthn*_test.go",
      "gen/handler/share/pickup_enum*_test.go",
      "bootstrap/authn_entry_guard_test.go",
      "bootstrap/authz_entry_guard_test.go",
      "bootstrap/pickup_entry_guard_test.go",
      "bootstrap/resource_entry_guard_test.go",
      "bootstrap/router_auth_guard_test.go",
      "bootstrap/admin_webauthn_http_test.go",
      "gen/handler/admin/admin_webauthn_gate_http_test.go",
      "transport/http/handler/share_reldir_test.go",
