      "title": "管理员令牌的角色声明必须是精确的 admin，且受签名保护",
      "verdict": "GenerateAdminToken 产出 role=admin 的可验令牌；换密钥后旧令牌立即失效",
      "tests": [
        "pkg/auth/l8_mfa_pending_test.go::TestL8_AdminTokenCarriesAdminRole",
        "pkg/auth/l8_mfa_pending_test.go::TestL8_AdminTokenRejectedByForeignSecret"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AB-04",
      "class": "auth_bypass",
      "title": "JWT 密钥保管：不落明文、取用返回副本、支持热更",
      "verdict": "密钥不以明文形态留存于内存（secretx 混淆），取用方拿到的是副本，热更改密钥即时生效",
      "tests": [
        "pkg/auth/jwt_secret_test.go::TestJWTSecret_GetReturnsCopy",
        "pkg/auth/jwt_secret_test.go::TestJWTSecret_HotReload",
        "pkg/auth/jwt_secret_test.go::TestJWTSecret_NotStoredInPlaintext"
